               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you that your patient, an 80-year-old female, was admitted to our department on 02/05/2019 and discharged on 03/05/2019 following an acute exacerbation of her known Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD). On admission, she presented with increased dyspnoea, productive cough and reduced exercise tolerance. Chest X-ray was performed to exclude pneumonia and pneumothorax. Arterial blood gas analysis confirmed hypoxaemia without significant hypercapnia. Spirometry supported the diagnosis of obstructive ventilatory impairment. She was treated with inhaled bronchodilators (salbutamol and ipratropium), systemic corticosteroids, and supplemental oxygen therapy with satisfactory clinical response. She was discharged in a stable condition. We recommend continuation of her inhaled maintenance therapy and close follow-up in your practice. Please do not hesitate to contact us should you have any queries.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
